Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Lipstick Temptation. A drink I made in a field hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.38,0:00:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a wonderful nurse, and there I lay with a rotten leg,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.75,0:00:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,a gunshot wound that had got infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.16,0:00:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Not romantic at all. It's hard to seduce anyone with a leg like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.48,0:00:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But I was dying for a drink,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.33,0:00:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and we soldiers had things the nurses wanted, like make-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.56,0:00:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I swapped a bright red lipstick for a bottle of vodka,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.67,0:00:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,on condition I could buy her a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.78,0:00:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But she couldn't drink vodka neat,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.58,0:00:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,so she pinched a bottle of Campari from the medicine cabinet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.12,0:00:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew she'd never get drunk on that,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.86,0:00:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,so I mixed in vodka and hid it with
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.40,0:00:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,grape tonic and a dash of grenadine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.96,0:01:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,An hour later her hand slid under my blanket to look after me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.48,0:01:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and that means a lot to a wounded soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.14,0:01:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm, voilà.
